# Performance Rules

## Allowed

- Server Components for data fetching
- Module-scope DB Pool
- Select only required columns
- Database indexes on FKs and filter columns
- `next/image` for images
- Lazy loading heavy client components

## Forbidden

- Unnecessary `"use client"` boundaries
- N+1 queries
- New DB connection per request
- Client-side fetching for SSR-able data
- Giant client state trees
- Unnecessary Context providers
- Unbounded queries without pagination

## Before optimizing

Read `/docs/PERFORMANCE.md`.
